@startuml
!include style.puml

' style.puml sets FontColor #FFFFFFF for participant titles, which renders as white on the
' pale LOGIC_COLOR_T1 / MODEL_COLOR_T1 / STORAGE_COLOR_T1 header boxes. Override it here so the
' titles stay readable at the size the Developer Guide embeds the diagram.
skinparam Participant {
    FontColor #000000
}

actor Tutor
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser
participant ":PaidCommand" as Paid
participant ":Model" as Model
participant ":Storage" as Storage
Tutor -> Logic : execute("paid 1")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand("paid 1")
Parser --> Logic : command
Logic -> Paid : execute(model)
activate Paid
Paid -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Paid : displayed students
note over Paid
Validate index and require a fee.
Failure returns before any mutation.
end note
Paid -> Model : setPerson(original, updatedWithoutFee)
note over Model
Keep active filter; a paid student
no longer matches the fees filter.
end note
Paid --> Logic : payment feedback
 deactivate Paid
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(model.getAddressBook())
Storage --> Logic : saved
note over Logic, Storage
A save failure is reported;
in-memory changes may remain.
end note
Logic --> Tutor : payment feedback
 deactivate Logic
@enduml
